<article class="env-definition" id="05NF">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05NF">Definition <span data-tag="05NF">17.17.3</span>.</a> Let $(X, \mathcal{O}_ X)$ be a ringed space. Let $x \in X$. An $\mathcal{O}_ X$-module $\mathcal{F}$ is <em>flat at $x$</em> if $\mathcal{F}_ x$ is a flat $\mathcal{O}_{X, x}$-module. </p>
